Rom 15:1 , The strong must bear with the weak;
Rom 15:2 , We must not please ourselves;
Rom 15:3 , for Christ did not so;
Rom 15:7 , but receive one another, as Christ did us all;
Rom 15:8 , both Jews and Gentiles;
Rom 15:15 , Paul excuses his writing;
Rom 15:28 , and promises to see them;
Rom 15:30 , and requests their prayers.
